# ==============================================================================
# LUMO'S DREAM DELIVERY SERVICE — ENVIRONMENT SPECIFICATION
# NOTE: The front-end client is 100% STATIC and requires ZERO environment variables.
# NEVER commit private API keys or database credentials to client-side code!
